            <ArticleTitle>Midsubstance Tendinopathy, Percutaneous Techniques (Platelet-Rich Plasma, Extracorporeal Shock Wave Therapy, Prolotherapy, Radiofrequency Ablation).</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>161-174</MedlinePgn>
